/-- **Wildcard pole.**  Every configuration with `E(y) ≤ E(P)` has at least one pair with inner
product `< -9/10`. -/
theorem pole_count : ∀ y ∈ SphereConfig 7, coulombEnergy y ≤ coulombEnergy pentBipyramid →
